        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Louis Brandeis\n- Organizations: Patient Privacy Rights, Supreme Court of the United States\n- Awards: Brandeis Award\n- Topics: health privacy\n\nFacts:\n- Louis Brandeis was born on November 13, 1856.\n- Louis Brandeis was an American lawyer.\n- Louis Brandeis served as an associate justice on the Supreme Court of the United States from 1916 to 1939.\n- Patient Privacy Rights is a health privacy watchdog.\n- The Brandeis Award is named in honor of Louis Brandeis.\n- Patient Privacy Rights awards the Brandeis Award.\n- Louis Brandeis died on October 5, 1941.",
